=== Default Keyword Sample ===
--- Primitive Defaults ---
int=0 bool=False string=
--- Class Default (zero-init) ---
Config(MaxRetries=0, Verbose=False, Label=)
--- Class Default (field initializers) ---
Settings(Timeout=30, Enabled=True, Mode=auto)
--- Bare Default (inferred) ---
Config(MaxRetries=0, Verbose=False, Label=)
--- Explicit Default Block ---
AppState(ErrorCount=5, Ready=True, Status=initialized)
--- Readonly Struct: new vs default ---
new Container() = Container(Code=99, Label=constructed)
default(Container) = Container(Code=42, Label=defaulted)
--- Initializers Per Construction ---
new Bare(0) = a 7 trail=ab
new Quiet() = q 7 trail=
new Declared(0) = a trail=aC
new Derived(0) = a x trail=xab
new Mark(0) = 3 trail=pS
--- Custom Setter: default writes storage ---
default(Gauge) = 0 mm trail=
new Gauge() = 0 mm trail=
assigned = 5 cm trail=LU
Reading = 0 0 trail=
Done!
